// 接着说;Boss 换阶段由 GAS 桥从能力系统收到的 GameplayEvent 发出。标签是测试模块注册的原生标签。

character 九S
character 波德

channel main
  pauses: 闲聊

channel 侦察

channel 闲聊

event 闲置

event Boss变阶段 gameplay DreamNarrativeTest.Boss.Phase
  阶段: int range 1..3 from magnitude

